        "label": "Launch — H-IIA",
        "description": "Tanegashima, Japan, 2020-07-19. UAE's Hope Probe (al-Amal) — the first Arab interplanetary mission. Launched on a Japanese H-IIA in a programme designed to leapfrog the Emirates' space-science capability by partnering with US universities + JAXA + ESA over a single mission timeline."
